\pard\keep\keepn\sb300\sa140\sl278\slmult0\b\f2\fs32 The player fantasy\par

\pard\sa120\sl278\slmult0\b0\f0\fs21 This Grid-Based-Strategy-Game is about commanding a deliberately chosen warband rather than controlling a huge army. Every unit occupies a real position on the battlefield, threatens a readable pattern of cells and must be committed at the right moment.\par
The aim is to create short, understandable battles with the depth of chess-like positioning, the personality of fantasy factions and the tension of managing when each unit will be ready to act again.\par

