\pard\intbl\sb60\sa60\sl278\slmult0\cf2\b\fs17 PROTOTYPE RULE  \cf1\fs23 If a complete match cannot be played with a grid, coloured capsules and simple UI, models and animations are not ready to be added.\cf0\b0\f2\fs22\cell\row 
\pard\sl278\slmult0\cf1\f0\fs21\par

\pard\keep\keepn\sb300\sa140\sl278\slmult0\b\f2\fs32 The first playable version\par

\pard\sa120\sl278\slmult0\b0\f0\fs21 The first build is a complete capsule-based arena battle that proves army construction, formation choices, directional attacks and recovery timing before content production expands.\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-230\li490\sa60\sl269\slmult0\tx360 One symmetrical arena profile and one shared test roster.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Capsule units with names, health and recovery information.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Private army setup, drag-and-drop formation placement and simultaneous reveal.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Selection, grid highlights, movement, facing, attacking, damage and defeat.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}Alternating activations, automatic passing and commander-elimination victory.\par

\pard\sa60\sl278\slmult0 Local play comes first; opponent AI, online play and polished art come later.\par

\pard\keep\keepn\sb300\sa140\sl278\slmult0\b\f2\fs32 A modular project\par

